@startuml
title F07 - Call family request
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
actor "Resident" as Resident
control "H06\nHub resident interface" as H06
control "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
control "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
control "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
control "B04\nIncident workflow" as B04
control "B05\nNotification routing" as B05
participant "Web Push provider" as Push
boundary "A04\nApp incidents" as A04
actor "Primary caregiver" as Caregiver
Resident -> H06: Press Call family
H06 -> H02: Persist urgent CallFamily event
H02 --> H06: Show saved locally / internet unavailable or sending
H02 -> H05: Record explicit resident action; do not wait for routine deadline
H02 -> H08: Prioritize urgent outbox item
H08 -> B04: Create one incident using stable event key
B04 -> B05: Schedule primary now and backup after bounded delay
B05 -> Push: Submit primary notification job
Push -> Caregiver: Deliver call-family notification
Caregiver -> A04: Claim and acknowledge incident
A04 -> B04: Idempotent claim/acknowledge command
B04 -> B05: Cancel still-pending backup jobs after human ACK
note over Resident,Caregiver: Outcome - A resident request is durable offline, escalated once online and remains open until a caregiver explicitly acts.
@enduml
